New: Survival! Pick a country and see how many birds in a row you can name at Pro level, with 15 seconds per photo. One mistake and your run is over. Every 5 in a row earns a celebration, and beating your best or the country record earns a bigger one. Climb the per-country high scores and try again. Species comparisons are also richer and more accurate, and we now filter out more photos where the bird is hard to find.
